# Local secrets and deployment-specific values
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets/*
!**/secrets/.gitkeep

# Private key material, wherever it lands. Public keys stay trackable.
*.pem
*_ed25519
*_ed25519_key
*_rsa
*_rsa_key

# Runtime state
**/data/
*.log

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
